	)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES:\ntFALL = 2.2 × (RDIS || RL) × CL where R_DIS = R_QOD + R_PD\n\nR_QOD is 0 (cause shorted) and R_PD is the internal resistor. Shorted, cause CL value is pretty high (all of the capas on the board), so I don't want a larger fall time."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.38 144.78 0)
		(size 50.165 25.4)
		(margins 1.6335 1.6335 1.6335 1.6335)
		(stroke
